  "title": "CGI and Caisse Alliance announce 10-year agreement to transform member digital banking, leveraging ebankIT’s nXP platform",
  "summary": "CGI (TSX: GIB.A) (NYSE: GIB), one of the largest independent IT and business consulting services firms in the world, today announced a 10-year agreement with Caisse Alliance to modernize its member digital banking platform through deployment of ebankIT’s nXP solution. This collaboration strengthens Caisse Alliance’s ability to deliver secure, scalable and future-ready digital services.",
